Unconditional 24/7 main hero sprint for G2/G2a/mods with no stamina/settings, making the game easier (requires Union 1.0h+)

To remove sprint after uninstall from your existing save game:
1. Load the affected save game.
2. Open Marvin console (F2).
3. Type and execute: call Mdl_RemoveOverlayMds PC_Hero "HUMANS_SPRINT.MDS"
4. Save the game in a new slot.

Pay attention, that there is an even simpler and more reliable way to speed up any animations (like run, sneak, dive, swim, jump - all separately) - with the help of zSpeedyAnis plugin: https://worldofplayers.ru/threads/41521/post-1136827

zSprint and zSpeedyAnis can be used together, but there is no point. Only one of them should be used.

